      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[0].tenNPC
      value: "D\u1EA1 S\xE1t Ma Qu\xE2n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].tenNPC
      value: "D\u1EA1 S\xE1t Ma Qu\xE2n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[2].tenNPC
      value: "D\u1EA1 S\xE1t Ma Qu\xE2n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[3].tenNPC
      value: "D\u1EA1 S\xE1t Ma Qu\xE2n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].idThoai
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[2].idThoai
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[3].idThoai
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[0].suDungNut2
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].suDungNut1
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[0].noiDungThoai
      value: "Sau nh\u1EEFng \u0111au kh\u1ED5, ta ch\u1EB3ng c\xF2n g\xEC."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].noiDungThoai
      value: "Song th\xE2n ng\u01B0\u01A1i? H\u1ECD t\u1EEBng ban ta m\u1ED9t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
        sinh... r\u1ED3i ch\xEDnh tay \u0111o\u1EA1n tuy\u1EC7t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
        \u1EA5y. M\u1ED9t th\xE2n ma c\u1ED1t, \u0111\u1ED5i l\u1EA5y ti\xEAn duy\xEAn
        c\u1EE7a h\u1ECD. Ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\xF3 bi\u1EBFt th\u1EE9 g\u1ECDi l\xE0
        Ti\xEAn C\u1ED1t T\xE1i Sinh... th\u1EF1c ch\u1EA5t l\xE0 g\xEC kh\xF4ng?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[2].noiDungThoai
      value: "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\u1EE9 gi\u1EEF l\u1EA5y c\xE2u h\u1ECFi \u1EA5y.
        M\u1ED9t ng\xE0y n\xE0o \u0111\xF3, khi ki\u1EBFm trong tay ng\u01B0\u01A1i
        kh\xF4ng c\xF2n ph\xE2n bi\u1EC7t \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \xE2n, o\xE1n, thi\u1EC7n,
        \xE1c... ng\u01B0\u01A1i s\u1EBD hi\u1EC3u."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[3].noiDungThoai
      value: "C\xF3 l\u1EBD ng\u01B0\u01A1i n\xF3i \u0111\xFAng. Con ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
        s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED5i thay. Ch\u1EC9 ti\u1EBFc... ta ch\u1EC9 g\u1EB7p h\u1ECD
        tr\u01B0\u1EDBc khi h\u1ECD bi\u1EBFt h\u1ED1i c\u1EA3i. C\xF2n ng\u01B0\u01A1i...
        l\u1EA1i ch\u1EC9 bi\u1EBFt h\u1ECD sau khi h\u1ECD \u0111\xE3 quay \u0111\u1EA7u"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[1].idThoai
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[2].idThoai
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[3].idThoai
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[0].luaChon1.textNut
      value: "Ng\u01B0\u01A1i t\xE0n s\xE1t th\xF4n l\xE0ng v\xE0 song sinh ta, c\xF2n
        b\u1EA3o l\xE0 ch\u1ECBu \u0111au kh\u1ED5 ?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].luaChon1.textNut
      value: "...Kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 n\xE0o. Cha m\u1EB9 ta... kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i lo\u1EA1i
        ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xF3."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].luaChon2.textNut
      value: "V\u1EADy l\xE0m sao \u0111\u1EC3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua n\xF3 ?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[2].luaChon1.textNut
      value: "V\u1EADy... r\u1ED1t cu\u1ED9c ai m\u1EDBi l\xE0 k\u1EBB mang nghi\u1EC7p?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[2].luaChon2.textNut
      value: "V\u1EADy l\xE0m sao \u0111\u1EC3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua n\xF3 ?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[3].luaChon1.textNut
      value: "Sau c\xF9ng, h\xE3y tr\u1EA3 gi\xE1 \u0111i"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[3].luaChon2.textNut
      value: "V\u1EADy l\xE0m sao \u0111\u1EC3 v\u01B0\u1EE3t qua n\xF3 ?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[0].textNut1
      value: You slaughtered the village and my parent, yet you claim to be the one
        suffering?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[1].textNut1
      value: ...Impossible. My parents... they weren't those kind of people
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[2].textNut1
      value: Then... in the end, who bears the karma?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[3].textNut1
      value: Finally, make an offer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[0].luaChon1.hanhDong
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[1].luaChon2.hanhDong
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[2].luaChon1.hanhDong
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoai.Array.data[3].luaChon1.hanhDong
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[0].noiDungThoai
      value: After the suffering, I am left with nothing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[1].noiDungThoai
      value: Your parents? They once gave me a path to live... only to sever it with
        their own hands. My demonic blood and bones, exchanged for their immortal
        fortune. Do you know what the so-called Immortal Bone Rebirth truly was?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[2].noiDungThoai
      value: Perhaps you are right. People change. It is merely unfortunate... I
        knew them before they ever knew remorse. While you... only knew them after
        they had turned back from their path.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 181372847061755494, guid: 9f6e5e2a1632c6b459dbe1a443ea9764, type: 3}
      propertyPath: danhSachCauThoaiTiengAnh.Array.data[3].noiDungThoai
      value: Keep that question with you. One day, when the sword in your hand can
        no longer tell grace from grievance, good from evil... you will understand
